 5. 🤖 Charted: Brutal tech dive 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: FactSet. Chart: Matt Phillips/Axios Tech stocks took a thumping yesterday as Jensen Huang's exit and jitters about Anthropic's looming IPO (due Thursday) spooked investors, Axios' Matt Phillips writes. 

 Chipmakers were hit hardest: The SOX, an index of major semiconductor stocks, tumbled 5.3% and is now down 34.4% from its peak over the past year. Get Axios Markets . 

 
 
