 8. 🦃 1 fun thing: Top Thanksgiving side 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: DoorDash . Map: Sami Sparber/Axios Mashed potatoes are America's most-ordered Thanksgiving side, Axios' Sami Sparber writes from new DoorDash data . 

 Spuds lead nationally and over-index in 11 states and D.C. — the most of any side. Carrots, corn and sweet potatoes each stand out in six states. Green beans claim five. Share this story . 

 
 
